DEFINE VARIABLE v-ventas AS LOGICAL.
DEFINE VARIABLE v-stock AS LOGICAL.
DEFINE VARIABLE v-produccion AS LOGICAL.
DEFINE VARIABLE v-compras AS LOGICAL.
STOP.
for each familia_articulo:
    DISPLAY cdg_familia dsc_familia.
UPDATE 
 v-ventas
 v-stock
 v-produccion
 v-compras.
for each articulo of familia_articulo:
 display cdg_articulo descripcion WITH USE-TEXT.

 ASSIGN
 Articulo.ventas_sino = v-ventas
 Articulo.stock_sino  = v-stock
 Articulo.produccion_sino = v-produccion
 Articulo.compras_sino = v-compras.
